---
const personalImageAlt = "Isai Colina, Engineering Lead";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import me from "../assets/isaiSquare.jpg";
---

<article
  class="grid items-start gap-10 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_280px] lg:gap-16"
>
  <div
    class="[&>p]:mb-5 [&>p>strong]:text-blue-700 dark:[&>p>strong]:text-blue-200 text-pretty leading-relaxed"
  >
    <p>
      I’m Isai Colina, an <strong>Engineering Lead</strong> with over <strong
        >8 years of experience</strong
      > across software engineering, product delivery, and technical leadership.
    </p>
    <p>
      My current work focuses on enterprise AI systems: intelligent agents,
      agentic workflows, retrieval, internal tools, automation, memory,
      observability, and human oversight. I care not only about what AI can do,
      but also about how it behaves in production, how decisions are governed,
      and how teams remain accountable for the outcomes.
    </p>
    <p>
      I lead initiatives across engineering, product, and operations,
      translating complex business processes into reliable technical
      capabilities. My background in Business Administration also helps me
      connect architecture and delivery decisions with organizational impact.
    </p>
    <p>
      Alongside my industry work, I write about AI engineering, intelligent
      agents, enterprise architecture, and engineering leadership. My long-term goal is to
      contribute to both industry and academia by helping future engineers
      understand how intelligent systems are designed, operated, and governed.
    </p>
  </div>
  <aside>
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-tl-[3rem] rounded-br-[3rem]">
      <Image
        width={280}
        height={320}
        src={me}
        alt={personalImageAlt}
        class="h-80 w-full object-cover grayscale-[20%]"
        loading="lazy"
        widths={[280, 400, 560]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 280px"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gray-950/80 p-5 text-white backdrop-blur-sm">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-blue-200">
          Current focus
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-200">
          Production AI systems, technical leadership, and engineering education.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</article>
